WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.940
Eddy smiled.

2
00:00:04.941 --> 00:00:09.397
"I love driving off-road.

3
00:00:09.398 --> 00:00:26.090
Dirt and rocks feel good!"

4
00:00:26.091 --> 00:00:28.646
Poppy tooted her horn.

5
00:00:28.647 --> 00:00:32.793
Honk! Honk!

6
00:00:32.794 --> 00:00:36.493
"Ugh," said Zippy.

7
00:00:36.494 --> 00:00:39.498
"I have to drive slowly.

8
00:00:39.499 --> 00:00:48.963
And I'll get dirty."

9
00:00:48.964 --> 00:00:56.005
"You'll be fine, Zippy," said Mr. Grill.

10
00:00:56.006 --> 00:01:02.255
Everyone drove into the woods.

11
00:01:02.256 --> 00:01:08.755
The path had lots of rocks.

12
00:01:08.756 --> 00:01:14.100
Jeb rolled over the rocks.

13
00:01:14.101 --> 00:01:18.585
Dipper drove around them.

14
00:01:18.586 --> 00:01:22.045
Poppy bumped up and down.

15
00:01:22.046 --> 00:01:25.918
"Whee!" she said.

16
00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:29.086
"This is fun!" said Eddy.

17
00:01:29.087 --> 00:01:35.375
He rolled over a big rock.

18
00:01:35.376 --> 00:01:38.534
A tree branch hit Zippy.

19
00:01:38.535 --> 00:01:41.881
"Oof!" he said.

20
00:01:41.882 --> 00:01:43.961
His tire hit a rock.

21
00:01:43.962 --> 00:01:47.880
"Ouch!" said Zippy.

22
00:01:47.881 --> 00:01:52.631
"Everybody, get ready!" said Mr. Grill.

23
00:01:52.632 --> 00:01:55.879
"The path gets muddy soon!"

24
00:01:55.880 --> 00:02:01.502
"Yay!" shouted everyone.

25
00:02:01.503 --> 00:02:07.414
"Ugh!" moaned Zippy.

